Hello friends! This is a technical update with bug fixes and performance improvements!
[list]
[*] An error when game backgrounds were not displayed and/or the game did not start was fixed. To do this, additional video codecs were integrated into the game installer;
[*] [b]Defensive Strike[/b] card now correctly gives Shield for killing an enemy;
[*] When you continue playing the game, the save window of the character you played for the last time now opens and the last save window is highlighted;
[*] [b]Prayer of Weakening[/b] card no longer inflicts Inflammation on the player;
[*] Character voices in battle now sound louder.
[/list]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/34384227/e1c5d908f4a30128af2559e244c0326d0a16bf38.jpg[/img]

This is a technical update that fixes annoying bugs and makes the game better :))
[list]
[*] The error that caused the Ice Giant to not display correctly was fixed;
[*] Passive Dungeon ability (-1 hp for each move) will now not kill you, but politely leave 1 Health point;
[*] Master of Forest will now correctly stop summoning the animals when the player uses the Animal Whistle;
[*] In-game sounds no longer overlap and cause a distortion;
[*] An event in the dungeon in which you are forced to discard 1 card less now works correctly;
[*] Now, when Sly’s voices increase the cost of playing a card, the color of the number turns red;
[*] The effect of the skill [b]Death[/b] during the battle with the Wax Witch now does not work if you use the Aspen Stake;
[*] The volume of replicas of characters in battle is increased;
[*] [b]Ash Scar[/b] card - mana cost reduced from 1 to 0;
[*] [b]Prolonged Strike[/b] card - mana cost reduced from 5 to 4. Initial damage increased from 9 to 10;
[*] [b]Impartial Fire[/b] card - mana cost increased from 1 to 3;
[*] Damage caused by the ability [b]Fang[/b] of Rat is increased from 3-5 to 5;
[*] Damage dealt by Nosferatu's [b]Drink Blood[/b] ability is increased from 4-5 to 6;
[*] [b]Chameleon[/b] Slime skill cooldown is increased from 1 to 2 rounds.
[/list]

