Hello everyone, friends! Over the past weekend, we received quite a lot of feedback regarding the latest update related to cards changes. We admit that not all decisions were correct, therefore we make a number of changes based on your feedback.

[h1]THE CARDS CHANGES[/h1]
[list]
[*] [b]Champion’s Pauldron[/b] - Mana cost reduced to 1 (Prev. amount: 2);
[*] [b]Occultist’s Pauldron[/b] - The card effect now works twice;
[*] [b]Tome of Envy[/b] - Now the damage of this card is increased by Strength. Initial damage increased to 6;
[*] [b]Tome of Wrath[/b] - Card damage reduced to 6, mana cost reduced to 1 (Prev. amount: 2);
[*] [b]Scales of Avarice[/b] - Now the damage of this card is increased by Strength. Initial damage increased to 5;
[*] [b]Inferno[/b] - Trigger chance increased to 30%. Now this card is revived exclusively at the end of the battle. Can be burned with a [b]Shield of Pride[/b] card;
[*] [b]Secret Set[/b] - Now adds 3 fragile cards [b]Throw a dagger[/b];
[*] [b]Snake Shiv[/b] - Damage increased to 5;
[/list]
[h1]OTHER IMPROVEMENTS[/h1]
[list]
[*] The situation where the [b]Black Knight[/b] could come with a couple of friends to the battle is fixed;
[*] Now the [b]Spirit of Despair[/b] applies the Phoenix effect until the end of the battle;
[*] The localization errors is fixed.
[/list]
Thank you guys for being indifferent to our game! Your feedback helps us make Deck of Ashes better :)

