Hello everyone, friends! This update will not be as big as the previous one, but it's very important. This patch will prepare the game for the next very important update :)

After changing the balance of the in-game economy, we received a number of your feedback. We are glad that you enjoyed what we did. Based on this, we present to you the following balance changes.

[h1]CARD'S BALANCE[/h1]
[h1]Lucia's cards:[/h1]
[list]
[*] [b]Impartial Fire[/b]: Then: Deal damage to an opponent equal to its Health points. You take as much damage. [b]Now:[/b] Strain. Destroy the enemy. Strain is always equal to current health;
[*] [b]Inferno[/b]: Then: Non-playable. Ash: At the start of your turn, you have a 25% chance to destroy all opponents except the bosses. You need 666 Ash to craft this card. [b]Now[/b]: Non-playable, Ashe. At the beginning of your turn, destroy one random opponent (except Bosses) with a 15% chance. This card respawns at the end of each battle.
[/list]
[h1]Sly's cards:[/h1]
[list]
[*] [b]Snake Shiv[/b]: Then: Phoenix.Deal 6 damage. [b]Now[/b]: Phoenix. Deal 4 damage;
[*] [b]Secret Set[/b]: Then: Phoenix. When this card is played, add 4 Fragile Throw Dagger cards to your Battle Deck. [b]Now:[/b] Phoenix. When this card is played, add 2 Fragile Throw Dagger cards to your Battle Deck;
[*] [b]Bouquet of Blades[/b]: now this card does not affected by Strength for sure. Spirit of Despair now casts Phoenix correctly on this card too;
[*] [b]Knockout[/b]: [b]Now[/b]: Preparation. Deal 8 damage. Apply Stun on an opponent. (Min. cost: 2);
[*] [b]Double Dodge[/b]: Echo. Increase the players dodge by 2 for 1 round.
[/list]
[h1]Neutral cards:[/h1]
[list]
[*] [b]Tome of Wrath[/b]: Choose an effect: Deal 7 damage 2. Draw a Periodic Damage card. Costs 2 mana;
[*] [b]Champion’s Pauldron[/b]: Choose an effect:. Apply Regeneration on yourself. Restore 10 Health points. Gain Shield. Costs 2 mana;
[*] [b]Occultist’s Pauldron[/b]: Choose an effect: Apply Bleed on an opponent. Apply Poison on an opponent. Apply Burn on an opponent. Costs 1 mana;
[*] [b]Tome of Envy[/b]: Lifesteal. Deal 3 damage. Costs 1 mana;
[*] [b]Scales of Avarice[/b]: Then: Choose an effect: Draw a card with the highest Mana cost. Draw a card with the lowest Mana cost. [b]Now[/b]: Choose an effect. 1. Spend 1 mana. Deal 3 damage. 2. Spend all the remaining mana. Deal 3 damage for each mana spent.
[/list]
[h1]OTHER IMPROVEMENTS:[/h1]
[list]
[*] [i]Did I ever tell you what the definition of insanity is?[/i]
Now voices tormenting Sly's mind will come more often;
[*] Now the Lich applies the Defender property to another undead, and not to himself;
[*] [i]We have 13 reasons why[/i] the Fanatic will stop choosing the suicide. Now he will be able to summon the assistants;
[*] The chance of getting the game event is reduced;
[*] [i]Attacking the Titan[/i]: the maximum health pull of the Bosses is reduced, and the minimum is slightly increased.
[/list]
[b]THANKS FOR READING AND DO NOT FORGET TO UPDATE THE GAME![/b]

