Hello everyone!

Throughout the week, we read your feedback on Sly and pondered every comment or tip you left on the social networks and on the forum. We were very happy to listen to you! We put all your ideas in one patch and added some extra features from us ːsteamhappyː

[h1]FANTASTIC CARDS AND WHERE TO FIND THEM[/h1]

[h1]2 NEW cards were added:[/h1]

[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/34384227/4343e46b55258925dbfa1e628a84fa748532e260.png[/img]

[h1]The following cards mechanic was changed[/h1]
[list]
[*] [b]Quick Throw[/b] - Deal 3 damage to a random opponent. Deal additional 1 damage for each Quick Throw you own.
[*] [b]Swift Strike[/b] - Deal 7 damage to all opponents whose Speed is lower than yours. Deal additional 2 damage for each Speed point that exceeds the opponent’s Speed.
[*] [b]Double Dodge[/b] - Echo - Increase your Dodge Chance by an amount equal to your Speed for 2 rounds.
[/list]

[h1]The mechanic and manacost of the following cards are slightly changed:
[/h1]
[list]
[*] [b]Sprint[/b] now costs 1 Mana;
[*] [b]Nimble Strike[/b] now costs 1 Mana;
[*] [b]Slay the Giant[/b] now deals 10 damage and 10 more per level;
[*] [b]Odious Chalice[/b] now triggers every third round;
[*] [b]Learned Technique[/b] now costs 0 Mana;
[*] [b]Amulet of Heartbeat[/b] now costs 1 Mana;
[*] [b]Treasure Map[/b] now costs 1 Mana;
[*] [b]Tome of Lust[/b] now costs 1 Mana;
[*] [b]Ironfist[/b] now costs 1 Mana and deals 6 damage;
[*] [b]The Boon[/b] now has the Phoenix property, as long as the player has 3 or less Strength;
[*] [b]Aspen Rosaries[/b] now costs 1 Mana;
[*] [b]Iron Bonds[/b] now costs 1 Mana;
[*] [b]The False God’s Banner[/b] now costs 1 Mana;
[*] [b]Antibacterial Potion[/b] now costs 1 Mana;
[*] [b]Beast Trap[/b] now costs 1 Mana;
[*] [b]Ring of Purity[/b] now restores 40 Health;
[*] [b]Shield of Pride[/b] now costs 3 Mana.
[/list]

[h1]CARD ARCHETYPE ICONS[/h1]

Each archetype have received it's own unique icon. This will make it easier to make a combat combinations of cards, especially for the new players ːsteamhappyː

[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/34384227/a0db35b676702bfb19422777b988ac9d3a79b29b.png[/img]

[h1]IMPROVEMENT OF CARD COLLECTION[/h1]

🃏Browse your card collection in a convenient way. The following filters were added:
[list]
[*] Card Affiliation;
[*] Card Manacost;
[*] Card Rarity.
